  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.0",
  "name": "Orpheus_Hearing",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tOrpheus Dataset: Enhanced Audio-to-ABC Notation Conversion\n\t\n\nThis dataset was specifically designed to train models for converting audio signals into ABC music notation, leveraging a customized workflow and mutation mechanisms specially designed with music theory.\nIt includes diverse musical scores, covering various styles and complexities, formatted to ensure consistency and usability in model training. The data has been carefully processed, cleaned, and augmented to support\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/BOB12311/Orpheus_Hearing.",
  "alternateName": [
    "BOB12311/Orpheus_Hearing"
  ],
  "creator": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "BonSun",
    "url": "https://huggingface.co/BOB12311"
  },
